stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Guardian
  Guardian --> Blocked: injection score >= 0.7, empty or too long
  Guardian --> Escalation: follow-up says "didn't work"
  Guardian --> Triage: allowed (PII redacted)
  Triage --> Knowledge: category, intent, priority, confidence
  Knowledge --> Resolver: KB hits + service status
  Resolver --> Escalation: security incident / P1 outage / low confidence / no KB answer / not in catalog
  Resolver --> Responder: how-to answered or policy denied
  Resolver --> ApprovalGate: plan contains tool calls
  ApprovalGate --> Responder: high-risk action - approval created (INTERRUPT)
  ApprovalGate --> Executor: low/medium risk or already approved
  ApprovalGate --> Responder: policy violation (scope / role)
  Executor --> Responder: all tools succeeded
  Executor --> Escalation: tool failed after retries
  Escalation --> Responder: ITSM incident + handoff package
  Responder --> [*]: reply passes output guardrail
  Blocked --> [*]
  note right of ApprovalGate
    Human decision resumes the graph:
    approve -> ApprovalGate -> Executor
    reject  -> Responder (closed)
  end note
